REM RedLilyGO - Evil Portal demo launcher. Authorized, isolated use only.
REM
REM This starts a Marauder captive portal on the board's own AP so a tester can
REM connect to the SSID and open the demonstration page.
REM
REM 1) Copy the page you want to the SD card under /Portal/ first, for example:
REM      /Portal/redlilygo-demo.html   fixed dummy values (demo@example.test / DEMO_ONLY)
REM      /Portal/mamakwifi.html       generic Mamak WiFi layout (no real branding)
REM      /Portal/campus-terms.html    generic campus WiFi terms layout (no real branding)
REM      /Portal/campus-status.html   generic hotspot status page (synthetic session data)
REM 2) Edit the two lines below to select the template (-w path) and the SSID (-n name).
REM    Add -p <password> for a WPA2 AP (8-63 chars); leave -p out for an open AP.
REM 3) Run this .ds from the dashboard payload list, or as /autorun.ds at boot.

WEB_OFF
ESP32M ssid -a -n RedLilyGO-Demo
ESP32M evilportal -c start -w /Portal/redlilygo-demo.html
REM ESP32M evilportal -c start -w /Portal/redlilygo-demo.html -p rahsia123
